      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1779, the British briefly occupied Verplanck, erecting Fort Lafayette before abandoning it.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        18
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://newyorkflow.blog/verplanck-new-york-guide-historic-hidden-gems",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The 19th‑century railroad extension turned Verplanck into a key brick‑making center during early industrialization.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
